SUMMARY:Coffee & Cannabis Co-Working
DESCRIPTION:AVL Digital Nomads\n## **Coffee & Cannabis Co-Working at Plant
  Bar 🌿💻 South Slope**\n\n**Thursday\\\, May 21 \\| 10AM–3PM**\n
 📍 Plant Bar – South Slope\n32 Banks Ave Suite #105\, Asheville\n\n***
 \n\n### **What this is all about**\n\nWorking from home is great… until 
 it’s the same chair\, same walls\, same everything.\nSometimes you just 
 need a new space and a few interesting humans around you.\nAVL Digital Nom
 ads turns a local spot into a **casual co-working hangout**. No fees\, no 
 structure\, no pressure.\nJust bring your laptop\, grab a drink\, and get 
 some work done alongside other remote workers\, freelancers\, and creative
  humans.\n\n***\n\n### **LOCATION: Plant Bar 🌿**\n\nWe’re taking over
  the colorful\, cozy **Plant Bar in South Slope** . Asheville’s first al
 cohol-free bar and café.\nExpect:\n\n* Specialty coffee\, herbal teas\, a
 nd cacao\n* Botanical elixirs and zero-proof cocktails\n* A vibrant\, slig
 htly quirky space designed for connection and creativity\n\nIt’s the kin
 d of place that makes working feel a little less like… work.\n\n***\n\n#
 ## **What to Expect**\n\n💻 A relaxed co-working environment\n☕ Unique
  drinks you won’t find anywhere else\n🌿 A creative\, welcoming space\
 n🤝 Easy conversation + new connections\n📍 A fresh Asheville spot to 
 enjoy\nCome for an hour or stay the whole time — totally up to you.\n\n*
 **\n\n### **Bonus: Stay for the Workshop (3PM)**\n\nWe’ll be wrapping th
 e day with a **workshop at 3PM with local coach Kai Northcott** focused on
  getting unstuck and actually starting the work that matters.\n👉 You’
 re welcome to **stay for the workshop** after co-working\n👉 **Registrat
 ion is separate**\, so be sure to sign up for that event as well if you wa
 nt to attend\n\n***\n\n### **Who this is for**\n\n* Remote workers\n* Free
 lancers\n* Entrepreneurs\n* Digital nomads\n* Anyone working from a laptop
  who wants to get out of the house
